{"id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-ivc.md","title":"Normalized Class-Number–Regulator Volume (local IVC)","display":"df-ivc — Normalized Class-Number–Regulator Volume (local IVC)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ivc","aliases":["58-df-ivc"],"display":"df-ivc — Normalized Class-Number–Regulator Volume (local IVC)","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ivc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ivc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ivc — Normalized Class-Number–Regulator Volume (local IVC)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota,C\\in V\">\\(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota,C\\in V\\)</span> (a presented characteristic-zero field and a value candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> (the standard rational-field structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]\">\\([K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]\\)</span> (the metatheoretic vector-space degree of the displayed field extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\">\\(h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\">\\(R(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\">\\(d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\)</span> (the standard class number, regulator, and discriminant of the presented number field)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}structure}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Q,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(q+_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)+_K\\iota(r)\n\\land\\iota(q\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)\\cdot_K\\iota(r)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota(0_{\\mathbb Q})=0_K\\land\\iota(1_{\\mathbb Q})=1_K\n\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\iota(q)=\\iota(r)\\to q=r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land [K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}structure}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Q,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(q+_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)+_K\\iota(r)\n\\land\\iota(q\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)\\cdot_K\\iota(r)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota(0_{\\mathbb Q})=0_K\\land\\iota(1_{\\mathbb Q})=1_K\n\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\iota(q)=\\iota(r)\\to q=r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land [K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land C=\n\\frac{h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\,\nR(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)}\n{\\sqrt{|d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)|}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land C=\n\\frac{h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\,\nR(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)}\n{\\sqrt{|d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)|}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S(C,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S(C,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Literal inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K\\)</span> does not make an arbitrary field structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> a rational extension. The repaired definition supplies an injective unital field embedding and computes finite degree over its image.</li>\n<li>The class number, regulator, discriminant, and extension degree are not constructed by the available set-level dependencies, so their use is explicitly metatheoretic rather than disguised as free object-language function symbols.</li>\n<li>“IVC” is only a local name for the displayed normalized class-number–regulator quantity; it is not the integral conductor of an order or character.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"[K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]","display":false},{"tex":"h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":false},{"tex":"R(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":false},{"tex":"d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}structure}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Q,K)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(q+_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)+_K\\iota(r)\n\\land\\iota(q\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}r)=\\iota(q)\\cdot_K\\iota(r)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\iota(0_{\\mathbb Q})=0_K\\land\\iota(1_{\\mathbb Q})=1_K\n\\land\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\iota(q)=\\iota(r)\\to q=r)\\\\\n&\\land [K:\\iota[\\mathbb Q]]\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldStructure}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&\\land C=\n\\frac{h(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\,\nR(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)}\n{\\sqrt{|d(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)|}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ivc\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S(C,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{InsensitiveVolumeConductor}_S\n(C;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":3157,"backlinks":[{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumberField}_S$ (metatheoretic number-field predicate from [[58-df-ivc]])"},{"id":"8b32674f42e4542b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2149ce014462d47d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5609e5894b943af5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-714","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-ivc.md|58-df-ivc]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}